!!! oculus/appearance/color.mat
!!! Color system for the Oculus desktop.
!!!
!!! Colors are organized into a semantic palette. Applications
!!! reference semantic roles (background, surface, text) rather
!!! than raw values, so themes can change without breaking anything.

book oculus.appearance.color

read everything from ny.lang.core

!!! A single color value in RGBA.

public color-value begin record
    field red as override long
    field green as override long
    field blue as override long
    field alpha as override long
end record
